    "detailed_description": "<h1>Buzz</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Toaster Jam is a fast paced breakfast themed arcade game with quirky puzzle elements which will test your reflexes and requires quick thinking. Guide a little carb-hungry toaster around spiky doughnuts and past angry forks to toast as many slices of bread as you can! Power up your toaster with coffee and jam boosts to complete levels faster and get higher scores.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br>\u2605 40+ levels to test your skills <br>\u2605 3 endless obstacle courses<br>\u2605 Built-in level editor with Workshop integration<br>\u2605 Charming toaster skins to unlock<br>\u2605 Steam Trading Cards<br>\u2605 Steam Achievements<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/590950/extras/ecb7f502e3ec88eb772e056d7ca5765a.avif?t=1664270360\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Coming Soon</h2><br>\u2605 More challenging levels<br>\u2605 Workshop integration<br>\u2605 Different game modes<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Developer</h2><br>",
